OL,3,GNEWSADrumcree negotiations are 'nowhere
OL,4,Anear dead' - NI secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FNegotiations over the controversial
OL,7,FDrumcree dispute are "nowhere near
OL,8,Fdead", Northern Ireland Secretary Sir
OL,9,FChris Bryant has said.
OL,11,FHe was speaking following further talks
OL,12,Fwith community leaders at Hillsborough
OL,13,FCastle on Wednesday.
OL,15,FThe talks came after lawyers for the
OL,16,FGarvaghy Road Residents Coalition
OL,17,Fissued a fresh legal bid on Tuesday to
OL,18,Ftry to prevent the march from going
OL,19,Fahead.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
